stretchy denim that keeps up with your life (and never loses shape).<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_n87thD":{"type":"item","settings":{"video":"shopify:\/\/files\/videos\/Untitleddesign15-ezgif.com-resize-video.mp4","column_size":"3","title":"Zero Waist Gap. Seriously.","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>A waistband that actually fits your smaller waist and curvy hips.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_U6rfgB":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Denise_effortless_confidence.jpg","column_size":"3","title":"Confidence that lasts all day","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>No sliding, no pulling—just jeans that stay flattering from early mornings to late nights.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}}},"block_order":["item_gJK6qB","item_n87thD","item_U6rfgB"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"full_width":true,"stack_on_mobile":false,"gap":"large","text_alignment":"start","subheading":"","title":"How are CURVJEANS different?","content":"<p>Because jeans should fit <em>you<\/em>, not the other way around.<\/p>","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"faq_EfT76h":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"item_YhyjJt":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"How do I know if CURVJEANS will fit me?","content":"<p>We get it—finding jeans that <em>actually <\/em>fit is a struggle. That’s why CURVJEANS are designed specifically for smaller waists and wider hips.<br\/><br\/>Check our <a href=\"https:\/\/curvjeans.com\/pages\/size-guide\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Size Guide\">size guide <\/a>with real measurements and do our fit quiz or simply DM us! Still unsure? Our returns are super easy.<\/p>"}},"item_THfNfg":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"What if I order the wrong size?","content":"<p>No worries! You have 14 days to exchange or return—completely hassle-free. Just try them on at home and if it’s not love at first fit, you'll easy start your return via our <a href=\"https:\/\/curvjeans.returnless.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/curvjeans.returnless.com\/\">return page<\/a>.<\/p>"}},"item_7egfLh":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"What if they're not the one?","content":"<p>No stress! Not head over heels? Send them back within 14 days - it's that easy! Our returns means zero drama 💕<\/p>"}},"item_kJGmng":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"What makes CURVJEANS different from regular jeans?","content":"<p>We’re made different. CURVJEANS are designed for women with curves—especially if you’ve got stronger legs, glutes, and a small waist. No awkward fits, no compromises—just jeans that move with you instead of against you.<\/p>"}},"item_M7ecB8":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"Are CURVJEANS stretchy?","content":"<p>YES! Our stretch is like magic! They hold their shape (no baggy knees!) but move with you all day. Dance, sit, run - these babies won't let you down.<br\/><br\/>Plus, they're actually comfy enough to wear all day!<\/p>"}},"item_btxATh":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"Will they stay up without a belt?","content":"<p>Yes! CURVJEANS are made with a special waistband that fits snug at the waist—no more sliding down or constant adjusting. You can finally ditch the belt.<\/p>"}},"item_Ckt4Wt":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"When will I receive my order?","content":"<p>Can't wait to get your perfect jeans? We get it! Your CURVJEANS will arrive in 5-6 working days. We'll keep you updated every step of the way! 📦✨<\/p>"}},"item_XkAAKm":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"Can I pay later?","content":"<p>Yep! Just select Klarna at checkout and you can try now, pay later—no extra fees. Super easy, super safe.<\/p>"}},"item_yrACzw":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"Do you ship internationally?","content":"<p>Yes we do!<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["item_YhyjJt","item_THfNfg","item_7egfLh","item_kJGmng","item_M7ecB8","item_btxATh","item_Ckt4Wt","item_XkAAKm","item_yrACzw"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"full_width":true,"subhead